From cae52d725531cb470bd09f7627fc7e43b1ae6949 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 04:15:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): name contained ancestors on session cards
 [daveey]

Walk local + sync-shadow replica parents for blocked_upstream, annotate
contained triage with episode/authority, and add upstream when the nearest
open ancestor is not blocked. Remote listed rows get the same walk.

Proof: tests fail on original source; 15 blocked_upstream + 40 session_tasks
parity tests pass. health check clean vs origin/main.
---
 .../kanban_session_activity_card_details.py   | 183 ++++++++++++++++--
 hermes_cli/kanban_session_outcome_tasks.py    |   2 +
 .../test_kanban_blocked_upstream_details.py   |  86 +++++++-
 3 files changed, 247 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)

diff --git a/hermes_cli/kanban_session_activity_card_details.py b/hermes_cli/kanban_session_activity_card_details.py
index a2d2b60a84..263c83df84 100644
--- a/hermes_cli/kanban_session_activity_card_details.py
